# macdoc: macOS Native Document to Markdown Converter

## Project Design Plan

Based on my analysis of the existing codebase patterns (especially `che-word-mcp`) and the requirements specified, I present the following comprehensive design for the `macdoc` Swift Package.

---

## 1. Swift Package Structure (Monorepo Architecture)

```
macdoc/
├── Package.swift                    # Root package manifest
├── README.md
├── Sources/
│   ├── MacDocCore/                  # Core streaming protocols and utilities
│   │   ├── Protocols/
│   │   │   ├── DocumentConverter.swift
│   │   │   ├── MarkdownWriter.swift
│   │   │   └── StreamingOutput.swift
│   │   ├── Models/
│   │   │   ├── ConversionError.swift
│   │   │   └── ConversionOptions.swift
│   │   └── Utilities/
│   │       ├── MarkdownEscaper.swift
│   │       └── StringExtensions.swift
│   │
│   ├── WordToMD/                    # Word-specific converter
│   │   ├── WordConverter.swift      # Main converter implementation
│   │   ├── Parsers/
│   │   │   ├── ParagraphParser.swift
│   │   │   ├── RunParser.swift
│   │   │   ├── TableParser.swift
