## 8. Key Design Decisions

| Decision | Rationale |
|----------|-----------|
| **No intermediate AST** | Per requirements - direct streaming conversion |
| **Protocol-based output** | Supports stdout, file, or string accumulation |
| **Separate modules** | Each format is independent, easy to add new ones |
| **ArgumentParser subcommands** | Clean CLI with `macdoc word`, `macdoc pdf` etc. |
| **ZIPFoundation** | Same dependency as che-word-mcp, proven to work |
| **XMLDocument** | macOS native, no external XML dependency |
| **Style inheritance chain** | Handles custom styles based on Heading1, etc. |

